<title>USA: Chic by h.i.s. fy96 shr loss $2.62.</title>
<headline>Chic by h.i.s. fy96 shr loss $2.62.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chic by H.I.S. Inc reported results for its fiscal year ended November 4, 1996:</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary loss$2.62	    profit$0.10</p>
<p> Net loss	  25,564	   profit1,012</p>
<p> Revs		318,790		  376,068</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary9,753,868		9,753,868</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. Chic by H.I.S. Inc said it will take a $15 million non-cash restructuring charge against earnings in the fourth quarter to establish manufacturing operations in Mexico.</p>
</text>
